{"zwei":{"titel":"1 · Zwei Endgeräte","aufgabe":"<p>Zwei Endgeräte hängen an einem Switch. Die Kabel stecken — aber ein Ping kommt nicht an.</p><p><strong>Dein Auftrag:</strong> Gib <strong>E1</strong> und <strong>E2</strong> je eine IP-Adresse im selben Netz (zum Beispiel <code>192.168.1.10</code> und <code>192.168.1.11</code>, Netzmaske <code>255.255.255.0</code>). Schalte dann oben auf <em>Aktion</em>, tippe <strong>E1</strong> an und tippe im Terminal <code>ping 192.168.1.11</code>.</p><p class=\"dim\">Schau dabei in den Mitschnitt: Vor der ersten Ping-Anfrage steht immer noch etwas anderes. Was fragt das Endgerät da?</p>","netz":{"v":1,"nodes":[{"id":"n1","kind":"host","name":"Endgerät 1","x":300,"y":420,"gateway":"","dns":"","on":true,"routes":[],"nics":[{"i":0,"mac":"02:00:5e:01:07:1f","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,"up":true}],"dateien":{"/Bilder":{"ordner":true},"/Bilder/schule.svg":{"bild":"@schule"},"/Bilder/landschaft.svg":{"bild":"@foto"},"/Bilder/marke.svg":{"bild":"@logo"},"/Bilder/smiley.svg":{"bild":"@smiley"}}},{"id":"n2","kind":"host","name":"Endgerät 2","x":900,"y":420,"gateway":"","dns":"","on":true,"routes":[],"nics":[{"i":0,"mac":"02:00:5e:02:0e:3e","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,"up":true}],"dateien":{"/Bilder":{"ordner":true},"/Bilder/schule.svg":{"bild":"@schule"},"/Bilder/landschaft.svg":{"bild":"@foto"},"/Bilder/marke.svg":{"bild":"@logo"},"/Bilder/smiley.svg":{"bild":"@smiley"}}},{"id":"n3","kind":"switch","name":"Switch 1","x":600,"y":620,"gateway":"","dns":"","on":true,"routes":[],"nics":[{"i":0,"mac":"02:00:5e:03:15:5d","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,"up":true},{"i":1,"mac":"02:00:5e:04:1c:7c","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,"up":true},{"i":2,"mac":"02:00:5e:05:23:9b","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,"up":true},{"i":3,"mac":"02:00:5e:06:2a:ba","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,"up":true},{"i":4,"mac":"02:00:5e:07:31:d9","ip":"","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false,